{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301320","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301320","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130132001:1":{"text":"탈린이라는 상인의 물건이에요. 전 잠깐 물건을 봐주고 있는 것뿐이고요.","source_cn":"它们属于一位叫做塔林塔的商人，我只是暂时看守它们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9687EFC7A0245470","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130132002:1":{"text":"우리 촌락을 발견한 탈린 씨가 이곳을 임시 거처로 삼겠다면서 상단을 데리러 갔어요.","source_cn":"他在发现我们部落后，准备带领商队来这里，把这作为暂时的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF539CD04E21A81F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130132003:1":{"text":"어쩌면 닉스의 가죽을 팔 수 있는 절호의 기회일지도 몰라요.","source_cn":"说不定，到时候尼克斯的皮毛也可以卖给他们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x548A3563D209327D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130132004:1":{"text":"하지만 그 전에 탈린 씨가 돌아오기 전까지 물건을 잘 지켜야 해요.","source_cn":"不过在他回来之前，我得帮他看好这些货物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE538D07E0F897BD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血法尔西":{"text":"파르시","source":"小蛮血法尔西","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}